{
  "$format": "janus-conformance-case/1",
  "id": "facade/pact-js-v3",
  "category": "facade",
  "facade": "pact-js",
  "title": "PactV3's builder, its binary files, multipart uploads and matching rules, are served and recorded as its pact converts.",
  "covers": [],
  "rows": [
    {
      "note": "Documentation/consumer-test-migration.md",
      "row": "`new Pact(options)`, `new PactV4(options)`, `new PactV3(options)`"
    },
    {
      "note": "Documentation/consumer-test-migration.md",
      "row": "`PactV3`: `given`, `uponReceiving`, `withRequest`, `willRespondWith`, `addInteraction`, `withRequestBinaryFile`, `withResponseBinaryFile`, `withRequestMatchingRules`, `withResponseMatchingRules`, `executeTest`"
    },
    {
      "note": "Documentation/consumer-test-migration.md",
      "row": "`matchingRules(rules)` and PactV3's `with*MatchingRules`"
    },
    {
      "note": "Documentation/consumer-test-migration.md",
      "row": "`multipartBody(contentType, file, part, boundary?)`, and `PactV3`'s `withRequestMultipartFileUpload`, `withResponseMultipartFileUpload`"
    }
  ],
  "why": "consumer-test-migration.md, pact-js: `PactV3`'s `given`, `uponReceiving`, `withRequest`, `willRespondWith`, `addInteraction`, its binary-file and matching-rule calls and `executeTest` are kept: the same calls, in pact-js's order. Its multipart uploads are adapted: the same calls, with a boundary derived from the part, and each part recorded.",
  "note": "Each multipart part's body is a `content-type` of its file's type, matched against the part's own `Content-Type` (ADR 0077); the body is split at the boundary the header names, as today's verifier splits it.",
  "subjects": { "typescript": "pact-js-v3.ts" },
  "expect": {
    "tests": [
      { "test": "theBuilderInOrder" },
      { "test": "addInteraction" },
      { "test": "binaryFiles" },
      { "test": "multipartUploads" },
      { "test": "matchingRules" }
    ],
    "contracts": {
      "web-app-orders-api.janus.json": {
        "content": {
          "interactions": [
            {
              "description": "create an order with V3 rules",
              "parts": {
                "request": {
                  "body": {
                    "members": { "sku": { "example": "A-1", "pattern": "^(?:^[A-Z]-\\d+$)$", "shape": "regex" } },
                    "shape": "object"
                  },
                  "headers": {
                    "members": {
                      "content-type": {
                        "entries": [
                          {
                            "shape": "http:media-type",
                            "type": "application/json",
                            "example": "application/json"
                          }
                        ],
                        "shape": "array"
                      }
                    },
                    "shape": "object"
                  },
                  "method": { "example": "POST", "shape": "equality" },
                  "path": { "example": "/orders", "shape": "equality" }
                },
                "response": {
                  "body": { "members": { "id": { "example": 1, "shape": "integer" } }, "shape": "object" },
                  "headers": {
                    "members": {
                      "content-type": {
                        "entries": [
                          {
                            "shape": "http:media-type",
                            "type": "application/json",
                            "example": "application/json"
                          }
                        ],
                        "shape": "array"
                      }
                    },
                    "shape": "object"
                  },
                  "status": { "example": 201, "shape": "equality" }
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "description": "exchange PDFs from V3",
              "parts": {
                "request": {
                  "body": {
                    "content-type": "application/pdf",
                    "encoded": "base64",
                    "example": "JVBERi0xLjQgYW4gb3JkZXI=",
                    "shape": "content-type"
                  },
                  "headers": {
                    "members": {
                      "content-type": {
                        "entries": [
                          {
                            "shape": "http:media-type",
                            "type": "application/pdf",
                            "example": "application/pdf"
                          }
                        ],
                        "shape": "array"
                      }
                    },
                    "shape": "object"
                  },
                  "method": { "example": "POST", "shape": "equality" },
                  "path": { "example": "/receipts", "shape": "equality" }
                },
                "response": {
                  "body": {
                    "content-type": "application/pdf",
                    "encoded": "base64",
                    "example": "JVBERi0xLjQgYSByZWNlaXB0",
                    "shape": "content-type"
                  },
                  "headers": {
                    "members": {
                      "content-type": {
                        "entries": [
                          {
                            "shape": "http:media-type",
                            "type": "application/pdf",
                            "example": "application/pdf"
                          }
                        ],
                        "shape": "array"
                      }
                    },
                    "shape": "object"
                  },
                  "status": { "example": 201, "shape": "equality" }
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "description": "get order 7 from V3",
              "states": [{ "name": "an order exists", "params": { "id": 7 } }],
              "parts": {
                "request": {
                  "headers": {
                    "members": {
                      "accept": {
                        "entries": [{ "example": "application/json", "shape": "equality" }],
                        "shape": "array"
                      }
                    },
                    "shape": "object"
                  },
                  "method": { "example": "GET", "shape": "equality" },
                  "path": { "example": "/orders/7", "shape": "equality" }
                },
                "response": {
                  "body": { "members": { "id": { "example": 7, "shape": "type" } }, "shape": "object" },
                  "headers": {
                    "members": {
                      "content-type": {
                        "entries": [
                          {
                            "shape": "http:media-type",
                            "type": "application/json",
                            "example": "application/json"
                          }
                        ],
                        "shape": "array"
                      }
                    },
                    "shape": "object"
                  },
                  "status": { "example": 200, "shape": "equality" }
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "description": "list orders from V3",
              "states": [{ "name": "no orders exist" }],
              "parts": {
                "request": {
                  "method": { "example": "GET", "shape": "equality" },
                  "path": { "example": "/orders", "shape": "equality" }
                },
                "response": {
                  "body": { "entries": [], "shape": "array" },
                  "headers": {
                    "members": {
                      "content-type": {
                        "entries": [
                          {
                            "shape": "http:media-type",
                            "type": "application/json",
                            "example": "application/json"
                          }
                        ],
                        "shape": "array"
                      }
                    },
                    "shape": "object"
                  },
                  "status": { "example": 200, "shape": "equality" }
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "description": "upload an order file from V3",
              "parts": {
                "request": {
                  "body": {
                    "members": {
                      "order": {
                        "entries": [
                          {
                            "members": {
                              "filename": { "example": "order.txt", "shape": "type" },
                              "headers": {
                                "members": {
                                  "content-type": { "of": { "example": "text/plain", "shape": "equality" }, "shape": "optional" }
                                },
                                "shape": "object"
                              },
                              "body": { "content-type": "text/plain", "example": "sku=A-1", "shape": "content-type" }
                            },
                            "shape": "object"
                          }
                        ],
                        "shape": "array"
                      }
                    },
                    "shape": "object"
                  },
                  "headers": {
                    "members": {
                      "content-type": {
                        "entries": [
                          {
                            "example": "multipart/form-data; boundary=order-boundary",
                            "pattern": "^(?:multipart/form-data;(\\s*charset=[^;]*;)?\\s*boundary=.*)$",
                            "shape": "regex"
                          }
                        ],
                        "shape": "array"
                      }
                    },
                    "shape": "object"
                  },
                  "method": { "example": "POST", "shape": "equality" },
                  "path": { "example": "/uploads", "shape": "equality" }
                },
                "response": {
                  "body": {
                    "members": {
                      "receipt": {
                        "entries": [
                          {
                            "members": {
                              "filename": { "example": "order.txt", "shape": "type" },
                              "headers": {
                                "members": {
                                  "content-type": { "of": { "example": "text/plain", "shape": "equality" }, "shape": "optional" }
                                },
                                "shape": "object"
                              },
                              "body": { "content-type": "text/plain", "example": "sku=A-1", "shape": "content-type" }
                            },
                            "shape": "object"
                          }
                        ],
                        "shape": "array"
                      }
                    },
                    "shape": "object"
                  },
                  "headers": {
                    "members": {
                      "content-type": {
                        "entries": [
                          {
                            "example": "multipart/form-data; boundary=receipt-boundary",
                            "pattern": "^(?:multipart/form-data;(\\s*charset=[^;]*;)?\\s*boundary=.*)$",
                            "shape": "regex"
                          }
                        ],
                        "shape": "array"
                      }
                    },
                    "shape": "object"
                  },
                  "status": { "example": 201, "shape": "equality" }
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
